{"3554960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wish for Eternity", "steam_appid": 3554960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/45bfad20a3cc23eb84ef6200bbfc14c1.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/45bfad20a3cc23eb84ef6200bbfc14c1.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two lost souls awaken, trapped in cages deep underground. Suddenly freed by an earthquake, they set out to escape the underworld. With no memory of their past, they ascend a towering dungeon, solving puzzles and battling demons to unlock each new floor representing a deadly sin domain. As they climb, fragments of their past return - they were once soulmates during their mortal lives. However, one fatal choice bound them for eternity in the spirit realm. They were tricked by an ancient entity. Now they have to redeem themselves and defeat their eternal warden. Will revenge save them from this curse, or will they accept their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/d77b90e2f4ec596038e7a86e61a28518.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/d77b90e2f4ec596038e7a86e61a28518.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span> Spirits constantly explore sin domains riddled with environmental puzzles and platforming sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/3e4088fcbea38aa9ae542ac29f1350db.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/3e4088fcbea38aa9ae542ac29f1350db.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/3e4088fcbea38aa9ae542ac29f1350db.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/3b0d9b9818bcf8310ef38b79675689fe.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/3b0d9b9818bcf8310ef38b79675689fe.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Chapter is a separate domain based on the Seven Deadly Sins and has a key mechanic that is only present in said chapter - this drives all puzzle and combat design within that domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing all 7 chapters is the main goal in Wish for Eternity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/94b2b96deb561071380522dbbfbe476d.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/94b2b96deb561071380522dbbfbe476d.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=1746 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/35e8f985ae56f955f784bf5dd6bb4208.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/35e8f985ae56f955f784bf5dd6bb4208.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span>HARMONIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue harmonizes objects to repair and control them for puzzles and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/35c71ed7793c733a6750c0d28ff0a7b6.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/35c71ed7793c733a6750c0d28ff0a7b6.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/35c71ed7793c733a6750c0d28ff0a7b6.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERCHARGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orange overcharges objects, turning them into weapons that break through obstacles and clear enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/5bbe210c6a14ee1ac2cc7d41bf158038.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/5bbe210c6a14ee1ac2cc7d41bf158038.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/5bbe210c6a14ee1ac2cc7d41bf158038.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon chapter completion, the Spirits are granted a Virtue, the opposite of the Sin they just defeated. The received Virtue unlocks new spiritual powers or upgrades existing ones. Unlike key chapter mechanics, unlocked Virtues carry over throughout the entire game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/f53780ddb2f278c6d4e97291b1c8ae57.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/f53780ddb2f278c6d4e97291b1c8ae57.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits engage in combat using their weapons and abilities, with sin-themed enemies blocking their ascent. Finally, they confront the Deadly Sin in an epic boss battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/271f496bd70a2355481234799d6ecea8.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/271f496bd70a2355481234799d6ecea8.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span>The Lantern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each chapter, the spirits retreat into their magical Lantern - a cozy, safe haven that expands as the story progresses, unlocking new activities and spaces to decorate.<br><br>Lantern activities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tPlaying and interacting with small toys and objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tCustomizing the characters &amp; decorating the interior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tRewatching collected memories &amp; highlights of the gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tExploring newly unlocked rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/45bfad20a3cc23eb84ef6200bbfc14c1.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/45bfad20a3cc23eb84ef6200bbfc14c1.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two lost souls awaken, trapped in cages deep underground. Suddenly freed by an earthquake, they set out to escape the underworld. With no memory of their past, they ascend a towering dungeon, solving puzzles and battling demons to unlock each new floor representing a deadly sin domain. As they climb, fragments of their past return - they were once soulmates during their mortal lives. However, one fatal choice bound them for eternity in the spirit realm. They were tricked by an ancient entity. Now they have to redeem themselves and defeat their eternal warden. Will revenge save them from this curse, or will they accept their fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it