554960/extras/5bbe210c6a14ee1ac2cc7d41bf158038.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VIRTUES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon chapter completion, the Spirits are granted a Virtue, the opposite of the Sin they just defeated. The received Virtue unlocks new spiritual powers or upgrades existing ones. Unlike key chapter mechanics, unlocked Virtues carry over throughout the entire game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/f53780ddb2f278c6d4e97291b1c8ae57.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/f53780ddb2f278c6d4e97291b1c8ae57.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits engage in combat using their weapons and abilities, with sin-themed enemies blocking their ascent. Finally, they confront the Deadly Sin in an epic boss battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/928227e7cf20073e90597300d6acb6e0.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/271f496bd70a2355481234799d6ecea8.avif?t=1780850855\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras_big/271f496bd70a2355481234799d6ecea8.webp?t=1780850855 width=1560 height=145 /></span>The Lantern</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each chapter, the spirits retreat into their magical Lantern - a cozy, safe haven that expands as the story progresses, unlocking new activities and spaces to decorate.<br><br>Lantern activities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tPlaying and interacting with small toys and objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tCustomizing the characters &amp; decorating the interior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tRewatching collected memories &amp; highlights of the gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•\tExploring newly unlocked rooms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.poster.avif?t=1780850855\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.webm?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/extras/7e8de43fce748277d5a87543b2f83e15.mp4?t=1780850855\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Wish for Eternity is a cozy-spooky 2-player co-op adventure across 7 Deadly Sin domains, each with unique mechanics, enemies, and an epic boss battle. Combine asymmetric spirit powers to fight and solve puzzles, then retreat to your warm, magical Lantern to rest, decorate, and recharge together.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554960/4cda109065544645d506955c6dbe10ef30e50baa/header.jpg?t=1780850855", "capsule_image": "https://sh